zzon-doc — Third-Party Notices
================================

This project inlines icon artwork as SVG path data (no runtime dependency,
no bundled files) inside:
  - zzon-doc/skills/zzon-doc/scripts/render.mjs
  - zzon-doc/skills/zzon-doc/scripts/build-docs.mjs

